=== BANG DOI CHIEU: LOI TU TIM BANG MAT (CODE REVIEW) VS LOI CPPCHECK PHAT HIEN ===

1. BANG DOI CHIEU CHI TIET:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STT  Ham bi loi              Loi phat hien bang mat (Review)   Loi cppcheck phat hien     Trang thai doi chieu
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1    list_insert_front       Thieu kiem tra malloc() tra NULL  [ERROR] uninitdata dong 34 cppcheck bat duoc duoi dang
                             (CWE-476 NULL Pointer Deref)      Memory allocated not init  chua khoi tao vung nho
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2    list_remove_by_title    Thieu free(cur) khi tach node     KHONG PHAT HIEN DUOC       CPPCHECK BO SOT!
                             (CWE-401 Memory Leak)             (cppcheck missed this)     Can phan tich dong (ASan)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3    list_count_UNSAFE       Bien count chua khoi tao          [WARNING] uninitvar d68    cppcheck bat chinh xac 100%
                             (CWE-457 Uninitialized Read)      Uninitialized var: count   ngay tai cay cu phap AST
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

2. GIAI THICH VI SAO CPPCHECK BO SOT LOI MEMORY LEAK TRONG list_remove_by_title:
- Trong ham `list_remove_by_title`, con tro `cur` duoc lay tu `head`.
- Khi thao tac ngat lien ket: `prev->next = cur->next;` roi `return head;`.
- Ve mat do thi luong dieu khien (Control Flow Graph - CFG):
  cppcheck chi thay `cur` la mot con tro cuc bo duoc tro vao mot phan tu cua danh sach duoc truyen
  tu tham so ben ngoai (`BookNode *head`).
- cppcheck mac dinh khong the biet chac chan rang doi tuong ma `cur` tro toi co con duoc tham chieu
  boi mot con tro nao khac trong pham vi toan cuc hay khong (Aliasing problem).
- Viec theo doi so huu vung nho (Memory Ownership Tracking) xuyen qua cac con tro lien ket
  la mot bai toan phan tich tinh cuc ky phuc tap, de gay ra bao dong gia (False Positives).
- Do do, cppcheck da bo sot loi memory leak nay! Day la ly do tai sao chung ta bat buoc phai ket hop
  phan tich dong (AddressSanitizer LeakSanitizer o Lab 3) de bat triet de loi ro ri bo nho o runtime.
